# Dashboard API

**Endpoint:** `GET /api/account/dashboard/`
**Authentication:** Required (`IsAuthenticated`)

---

## Description

This API returns dashboard data based on user role:

### Admin (`role = admin`)

* View all leads
* Apply filters (case_id, search, status, campaign)
* Get summary metrics

### Team Member (`role = team_member`)

* View assigned leads only
* Get:

  * Summary metrics
  * Action queue (escalations, callbacks)
  * Scheduled callbacks

### Normal User

* View only their own lead data using `case_id`

---

## Query Parameters (Admin Only)

| Param    | Description                               |
| -------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| case_id  | Exact case ID filter                      |
| search   | Search across case_id, name, email, phone |
| status   | Filter by lead status                     |
| campaign | Filter by campaign name                   |

---

