# DOCUMENT & OCR APIs

## 7. Upload Documents

**Endpoint:** `POST /upload-documents/`
**Description:** Upload PAN, Aadhaar, and Bank Statement (Max 5MB per file).

### Content-Type

`multipart/form-data`

### Fields

* `pan_card` (PDF/JPG/PNG, max 5MB)
* `aadhaar_card` (PDF/JPG/PNG, max 5MB)
* `bank_statement` (PDF/JPG/PNG, max 5MB)

### Success Response

```json
{
  "message": "Document processing completed",
  "results": {
    "pan": {"status": "COMPLETED", "data": {}},
    "aadhaar": {"status": "COMPLETED", "data": {}},
    "bank": {"status": "FAILED", "error": "File not provided"}
  }
}
```

---

